    <item>
      <title>Arsenal Are Wembley-Bound! Carabao Cup Final Booked After Ousting Chelsea</title>
      <link>https://www.foxsports.com/stories/soccer/arsenal-player-ratings-vs-chelsea-the-gunners-are-going-to-wembley-mikel-artetas-side-reach-carabao-cup-final-as-kai-havertz-lands-fatal-blow-against-former-side</link>
      <description>Arsenal are into the final of the Carabao Cup after beating Chelsea 1-0 on Tuesday, prevailing 4-2 on aggregate. The Gunners showed little attacking appetite at the Emirates having entered the game with a lead to protect, and ultimately their visitors didn't ask enough meaningful questions to ever put their place at Wembley in serious doubt.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.foxsports.com/stories/soccer/arsenal-player-ratings-vs-chelsea-the-gunners-are-going-to-wembley-mikel-artetas-side-reach-carabao-cup-final-as-kai-havertz-lands-fatal-blow-against-former-side</guid>
